%% Three orchestration layers
flowchart TB
  subgraph L3["Layer 3 — Agent session control"]
    direction LR
    ORC[Orchestrator] <-->|prompts · ACP events · permissions · traces| DRV[Driver]
    DRV <-->|ACP| AGENT[Coding agent]
  end

  subgraph L2["Layer 2 — Workspace provision"]
    direction LR
    DRV2[Driver on first boot] --> INST[Install agent · tools · skills · plugins]
    INST --> CLONE[Clone repo · restore caches]
  end

  subgraph L1["Layer 1 — Sandbox lifecycle"]
    direction LR
    SM[Sandbox Manager] --> HOST[Hosting backend<br/>k8s / VM / podman]
    HOST --> BOX[Sandbox compute]
  end

  L3 -.->|runs inside| L1
  L2 -.->|runs inside| L1
  ORC -->|CreateSandbox / Stop / Archive| SM
